@@ -0,0 +1,45 @@
+# GreenOps Demo Patch Notes
+
+Demo-safe fixes applied before presentation.
+
+## AI provider swap
+- Removed Anthropic API usage from:
+  - `api/diagnose.js`
+  - `api/verify-evidence.js`
+  - `api/client-assistant.js`
+- Moved AI calls to OpenAI Responses API.
+- Demo model routing:
+  - `OPENAI_VISION_MODEL` / `OPENAI_MODEL` default: `gpt-5.5`
+  - `OPENAI_TEXT_MODEL` default: `gpt-5.4-mini`
+- Added automatic fallback for demo safety:
+  - Vision: `gpt-5.5` → `gpt-5.4` → `gpt-4o`
+  - Text: `gpt-5.4-mini` → `gpt-5.4` → `gpt-4o-mini`
+
+## Camera / diagnosis path
+- Kept live camera capture flow.
+- AI Diagnosis is preview-only.
+- Scan/ticket persistence happens only on Submit Service Log.
+- Repeated Run AI Diagnosis clicks will not create duplicate scan records or duplicate tickets.
+- Submit Service Log has a submitting guard to prevent double-save.
+
+## Error hardening
+- Added safer JSON handling for AI responses so HTML/server errors do not crash the frontend.
+- Added localStorage quota error handling with a clear demo-safe message.
+- Added `npm run check` syntax validation script.
+
+## Demo setup
+Create `.env.local` locally or add Vercel environment variables:
+
+```bash
+OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-openai-key-here
+OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.5
+OPENAI_VISION_MODEL=gpt-5.5
+OPENAI_TEXT_MODEL=gpt-5.4-mini
+```
+
+Then run:
+
+```bash
+npm run check
+vercel dev
+```
